("glowbaby-gb-5491743789","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["cosleeping","safe_sleep_fear","conflicting_advice"],"For example they really seem to support cosleeping. We have chose not to cosleep for the risks associated with SIDS","3-star review on the app's articles.","unsafe sleep (cosleeping / SIDS)"),
("glowbaby-gb-5491743789","parent_unspecified","unknown","others_said",["guilt","conflicting_advice"],"I already get enough judgement from other mothers I don’t need to be judged by an app as well.","3-star review titled 'Great for tracking, articles are garbage'.",""),
("glowbaby-gb-3991246798","parent_unspecified","newborn_0_8_weeks","belief",["app_tracking","information_overload"],"once the baby is putting on weight and eating routine established, I found it was stressing me looking at whether she fed for 16 or 23 minutes. [...] I know try to use my own instinct kore and actually listen to what my baby is telling me.","2-star review; used the app from the hospital trip home.",""),
("glowbaby-gb-3991246798","parent_unspecified","unknown","price_signal",["price_value","partner_split_nights"],"Was disappointed I pay this money then the other caretakers didn’t receive the benefits.","2-star review; premium did not extend to other caregivers.",""),
("glowbaby-us-8110334168","experienced_mother","newborn_0_8_weeks","question",["app_tracking","short_naps"],"Why is my baby fussy? Maybe didn’t get a good nap in that day? I like to look back at the history on when baby had a great day and try to replicate what I did","5-star review; second baby, one month old.",""),
("glowbaby-us-8110334168","experienced_mother","newborn_0_8_weeks","desire",["bedtime_battle","app_tracking"],"Something that’s important to me as a mom is sleep and I don’t start bedtime at midnight. I start bedtime at 7 or 8.","5-star review asking for the 24-hour view to start at bedtime.",""),
("glowbaby-us-8827970880","parent_unspecified","unknown","objection",["price_value","comparison_other_babies"],"we’re constantly stressed about if they got enough to eat or if they’re still hungry or if they’re teething early, or running a fever-we shouldn’t be worried if they’re up to par for their age, so I think we should be able to compare for free.","3-star review on paying to compare with other babies.",""),
("glowbaby-us-8827970880","parent_unspecified","unknown","price_signal",["price_value"],"Surely in the future, the developers of this app will take it easy on customers during an inflation of literally everything.","3-star review, 2022.",""),
