("glowbaby-us-4687140733","parent_unspecified","unknown","tried_failed",["short_naps","app_tracking"],"I’ve been trying some other more streamlined trackers, and currently like Huckleberry because we’re in the throes of sorting out nap time and it helps guesstimate when the next nap should be.","3-star review; bought premium while pregnant.",""),
